  "source_sha256": "9a9005a2b4e43931676b0de573b8663c60377c8a2002e46140dbdac5f6735840",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "12316112f9916bb22819ed7a9200646540b0e20d3dbb8106327180a231e2448f",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nWibble-Wobble\nRide",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2b2795d92554acf5ee57b872c48bc8fd2f24e8f6c59fe4ed82f7380be8130446",
      "text": "“Look at them go!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!\n“I want to ride, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5d7c4a39d81601dfc7ea4bd937aa51affefd9f025b441ef95c45bb00f05be4b7",
      "text": "Wukong put on his helmet.\n“Ready!”\n“Um… it’s backward!”\nWukong giggled.\n“Let’s try again!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0561b7601fd255faaa34fec68212eb8d8d0c39fdd9838fc29627dfd6476d0fb9",
      "text": "He pushed with his feet.\nScoot. Scoot. Scoot.\n“Look! A monkey scooter!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8d8bd96b98c239414d3a5550b64673e36fc1b481e584740c6316110aa34f52ca",
      "text": "Feet up…\nWibble! Wobble!\nPLOP!\n“Hello, grass.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5fe36fc46a433d702c007c6afd4e1fce64068f954ff8057a9786c7985da0592a",
      "text": "“Maybe the bell will help.”\nDing! Ding!\nThe bell worked.\nThe wobble stayed.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "351ecaaace5c25a468b1fb8ccbeb5cb574db286270bd83091c45dff3ecd57722",
      "text": "Pigsy held the seat.\n“Eyes ahead. Nice and slow.”\nRabbit cheered.\n“You can do it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "03747e81c64baf018899e399b1fb4799a4c49432b76c7bd75f7a17dd9b1e0c12",
      "text": "Wukong tried again.\nOne push.\nOne pedal.\nTwo.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1096625bcf8a91cf407b13029dc73828b3b163ef93682f5eccf2f9b5c0fdbddc",
      "text": "He wobbled left.\nHis tail wobbled right.\n“My tail is learning, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "684188dd1e27641d3a99b9b0eddedf020d1275567391a124b26bc43d2731ed44",
      "text": "He tried a little every day.\nSome rides were short.\nSome were wobbly.\nHe kept trying.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "89a77a33118d461f927465151f2447961618f5a1c09cfec24e0bcb773467901a",
      "text": "Then, one evening…\nPigsy let go.\nWukong kept going!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "13a7759175efb6b49150133610737e4edc70998e2ae2ce7b26002f485dcacc2f",
      "text": "“I’m doing it!”\nHis scarf fluttered.\nHis tail made a loop.\nEven his ears felt proud.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "17553495d1e1f2ea2ed6d7d65e305f647183cd48530cd9b85153605297504b23",
      "text": "He learned to turn.\nHe learned to stop.\nJust before a puddle.\n“After you, little duck.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d4beb2053e70a04e5d8884064312492e32f6388f75996175cc40ba8a007c6a50",
      "text": "Now they rode together.\nNo rush.\nJust happy wheels.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "38dca4da430fca4dcd8f951ed2bef0648ff1c608e46741b999af2d4cd3f5dd0a",
      "text": "At home, he parked his bike.\n“Goodnight, wheels.”\n“Goodnight, wobbles.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ee6a8f88d74f1705a1a9868b45d21bb16cc42a54d16e151323656d1bf4064007",
      "text": "Wukong curled up in bed.\nIn his dreams,\nthe path was smooth.\nAnd the wheels whispered,\n“Shhh…”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
